'''Cosmoem''' (Japanese: '''コスモウム''' ''Cosmovum'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

