==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Cosmoem|101}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Stiffen''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kakuna|33}} and {{TCG ID|Base Set|Metapod|54}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

